ords were all familiar I could  make it out but it's the lack of words  and so again be realistic if you're  doing a language that has a lot of  common vocabulary with a language that  you know you're going to do better but  at any rate I will be updating your  regular  with videos talking about about my  specific goals what I'm doing and  hopefully that will be of use to you and  I very much encourage you in order to go  after a period of concentrated effort  this 90-day challenge and one more thing  i invite you to send in your questions  one witty video a week I'm going to be  answering questions from our you know  other participants and I should point  out as I think I did in the previous  video that members of our link team mark  Sam and Kieran and Miguel are also going  to be doing the 90 day challenge so best  of luck to you in your 90 day challenge  and look forward to hearing from you bye  for now
 

